# scripts/opcount: `collectbench bench reslicefield N` is the reslice
# workload with the line in a record's field and the record's number read
# after the collect (GP-RESLICE-FIELD). The control copies the field's
# part into a slice made to size.
unit element
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench reslicefield {n}
control benchmarks/collect/testdata/control
